	"tips": "・Business Manager visa is for **business management or operation**\n\n・Requires either **investment of 5 million yen or more** or **employment of 2 or more Japanese nationals**\n\n・Check the latest application requirements at the [Immigration Services Agency](https://www.moj.go.jp/isa/)\n\n・Key documents include business plan, funding proof, business registration certificate, etc.\n\n・Must demonstrate management capability through education, business experience, or qualifications",
